{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"半单 Abel 范畴"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"半单Abel范畴"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>若 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 的每个对象均为有限个"},{"Local":{"url":"单对象","text":"单对象"}},{"Plain":"的直和, 则称之为<strong>半单 Abel 范畴</strong>.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"半单环","text":"半单环"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}